WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.375
The first time, choose "Swiss" or "Global".

2
00:00:03.425 --> 00:00:05.184
Every match starts on Home.

3
00:00:05.234 --> 00:00:08.397
"Official match": today's home game of your club, or enter the game yourself. Saved on the server.

4
00:00:08.447 --> 00:00:11.118
"Test match": practice with sample teams. Never saved on the server.

5
00:00:11.168 --> 00:00:13.830
"Easy match": Unofficial · no rosters or signatures.

6
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.548
"Scoreboard": points and sets only, no match.

7
00:00:16.598 --> 00:00:19.628
Here: "Test match".

8
00:00:19.678 --> 00:00:23.090
"Menu" → "Home" goes back. The match stays on this device.

9
00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.715
"Continue match" opens it again.

10
00:00:25.765 --> 00:00:30.984
"Delete match", under it, removes it from this device.

11
00:00:31.034 --> 00:00:33.811
An official match: teams, score, last saved and its state.

12
00:00:33.861 --> 00:00:36.631
"Scoring here": the server knows this device scores it.

13
00:00:36.681 --> 00:00:43.681
No connection? Scoring goes on, on this device.

14
00:00:46.231 --> 00:00:49.072
"Unsent changes": not on the server yet. They are sent once online.

15
00:00:49.122 --> 00:00:51.074
Back online: sent.

16
00:00:51.124 --> 00:00:53.793
The "Game PIN" lets another device continue this match.

17
00:00:53.843 --> 00:00:59.813
"Restore match" loads a match from the server or from a backup file.
